  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nIn Nomori, up and down can change from moment to moment. Place, shift, and rotate portals to change the direction of the environment around you and make every surface a floor! Manipulate the gravity direction of other objects to solve a wide range of puzzles.<p></p>\n<p>You are Kiko, a curious girl stuck in a whimsical spirit world in trouble. Meet a colorful cast of characters that will challenge Kiko to see the world, and herself, from new perspectives. As Kiko and the Spirits help each other out, she may yet find a way to heal Nomori and get back home.</p>\n<p>Explore each level as you wish: around every corner of your surroundings you’ll find rewards! Play with gravity and timing in a physics-based world, and combine your Spirit Powers to overcome obstacles your own way.</p>\n<p>Travel through the four seasonal domains of Nomori, each one putting new twists on the mechanics you’ve learned. Gradually become a master of your magical abilities as you meet and reunite the Spirits of Nomori.<br>\n</p>",
